@* Two maps beside each other — each one gets its own compiler instance and its own lazy-loaded
   MapLibre. Draggable puts a grab handle on the Hanoi marker.
   w-full: the Example preview wraps samples in a flex row, and a flex item sized by its
   content collapses — a grid of maps has no intrinsic width, so the tracks (and both maps)
   caved to zero. EChartsPage keeps its grids OUTSIDE any Example for the same reason. *@
<div class="grid w-full gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">
    <Map CenterLat="21.028511" CenterLng="105.804817" Zoom="11" Height="300px">
        <MapMarker Lat="21.028511" Lng="105.804817" Popup="Hanoi" Draggable />
    </Map>
    <Map CenterLat="16.054407" CenterLng="108.202167" Zoom="10" Height="300px">
        <MapMarker Lat="16.054407" Lng="108.202167" Popup="Da Nang" />
    </Map>
</div>
